@startuml
!include PlantUML.style
hide empty members
hide circle
left to right direction
class ProductsController {
  {static} -AllProductsKey : string
  {static} -ProductKey(id) : string
  +GetProduct(productId)
  +UpdateProduct(productId, product)
}
class ProductCache {
  +Settings : CacheSettings
  +GetOrLoadAsync<T>(key, load) : T
  +InvalidateAsync(keys)
  -LoadFromDbAsync<T>(load) : T
}
class CacheSettings {
  +Enabled : bool
  +DbDelayMs : int
}
class ProductsDbContext
interface IConnectionMultiplexer <<interface>>

ProductsController --> ProductCache : lee e invalida
ProductsController --> ProductsDbContext : guarda los cambios
ProductCache --> IConnectionMultiplexer : Redis
ProductCache --> CacheSettings

note bottom of ProductCache : load es la lectura de PostgreSQL:\nsolo se ejecuta en un miss
@enduml
